; Storage on a 8250, double-sided diskette, for a Project whose Container is
; the `d82`. The same shape as `pet/d64.ngp` and the same driver: a unit is a
; **track** and its number is the track's, `size` is the widest track and
; therefore a stride, and what a narrower one does not have is held against
; every image. Unit zero is no track, and this surface keeps two for itself —
; the directory's and the one the map has of its own — so those are zero too.
;
; 1 051 648 bytes of sectors are left for a program, against the 169 984 of a
; `d64`. The two numbers are checked against the Container (`NGA1238`).
;
; A Project includes this beside `pet/3032.ngp`.
storage { units 155  size 7424 }

modules { "pet/disk.asm"  "stream/zx0.asm" }
resident { disk, zx0 }
